TOV2414: OVARIAN-COMPATIBLE expression (Mullerian-positive, not SATB2/CDX2-driven) [measured: KRT7 z=+2.58, PAX8 z=+0.28, SATB2 z=+0.17, CDX2 z=+0.21, MUC5AC z=+4.25, ovarian_index=+1.26]. Published ovarian derivation (Cellosaurus CVCL_A1SR; Sauriol 2020) and a matching KRAS G12A candidate observed here, so the ovarian call does not rest on expression alone. Carries a tumour-only candidate SMAD4 frameshift + low SMAD4 mRNA — a co-occurring event (SMAD4 loss occurs in a subset of MOC), NOT evidence of pancreatic origin given the published derivation/reference STR record. NB its measured SATB2 is NOT low (see literature_vs_measured).
   provenance: Cellosaurus CVCL_A1SR; primary paper Sauriol 2020 REPORTS (their IHC/sequencing, not measured here): KRAS G12A, SATB2-negative, focal PAX8+

VOA8762: GI-LEANING (Mullerian-low PAX8-/KRT7-, intestinal CDX2+) [measured: KRT7 z=-1.55, PAX8 z=-1.15, SATB2 z=-0.59, CDX2 z=+2.52, MUC5AC z=-0.43, ovarian_index=-0.76]. NO external provenance (absent from Cellosaurus, no primary paper), so expression is the only in-house check and it can raise a flag but cannot call origin. STR + IHC required.
   provenance: NONE (absent from Cellosaurus; no primary paper)

VOA8771: GI/COLORECTAL-LEANING (SATB2+/CDX2+) [measured: KRT7 z=-0.98, PAX8 z=-1.23, SATB2 z=+0.80, CDX2 z=+3.64, MUC5AC z=-0.14, ovarian_index=-1.91]. NO external provenance (absent from Cellosaurus, no primary paper), so expression is the only in-house check and it can raise a flag but cannot call origin. STR + IHC required.
   provenance: NONE (absent from Cellosaurus; no primary paper)
